chapter.v:
He shall 


judge between, 


many peoples, and shall decide disputes for strong nations far away; and they shall beat their swords into plowshares, and their spears into pruning hooks; nation shall not lift up sword against nation, neither shall they learn war anymore;

In that 


day, declares, 


the LORD, I will assemble the lame and gather those who have been driven away and those whom I have afflicted;
